OL,3,GNEWSACouncil criticised over breast
OL,4,Ascreening unit fees
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Devon council has come under
OL,7,Fcriticism after charging the NHS to
OL,8,Fplace a mobile breast screening unit in
OL,9,Fits car parks, prompting health
OL,10,Fofficials to use private sites instead.
OL,12,FTeignbridge District Council's policy
OL,13,Fhas been challenged by Buckfastleigh
OL,14,Ftown councillor Sue Clarke, who said
OL,15,Fresidents were angry that the Torbay
OL,16,Fand South Devon NHS Foundation Trust
OL,17,Fhad been asked to pay thousands of
OL,18,Fpounds to use council-owned car parks
OL,19,Ffor the service.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
