OL,3,GNEWSACouncil criticised over breast
OL,4,Ascreening unit fees
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe trust said it was grateful to
OL,7,Forganisations for providing alternative
OL,8,Flocations.
OL,10,FA district council spokesperson said it
OL,11,Fhad offered the maximum reduction
OL,12,Fallowed under its policies, and was
OL,13,Freviewing its approach to fees and
OL,14,Fconcessions.
